# [The same app on glowcap and Goblins]($section.id('the-same-app-on-glowcap-and-goblins'))

Each application is written once in Racket and run with two backends:
[Spritely Goblins](https://spritely.institute/goblins/) and glowcap's Racket
binding. The actors run in Racket, so these results do not measure glowcap's
Zig actor runtime or concurrent load. The “glowcap + time-travel” row enables
snapshot support without taking snapshots.
The [benchmark methodology](https://github.com/glowcap-org/glowcap/blob/main/bench/goblins/METHODOLOGY.md)
explains what is held constant.

